 Run its tests with `npm test`.
+
+## Task identifiers
+
+Every task returned by `add` has a list-unique string `id`. Use `get(id)` to retrieve it after its
+title changes. The title-based operations (`find`, `complete`, `reopen`, `rename`, `tag`, `untag` and
+`remove`) also accept this identifier.
+
+Documentation version: 0.4.0 (2026-10-26)
